## 💡 Example: Natural Language Test (Gemini LLM)

```python
from ai_adk.mcp_agent import MCPBrowserController

def test_login_mcp(page):
    mcp = MCPBrowserController(page)
    output = mcp.run(
        "Go to https://example.com/login. "
        "Fill username => testuser. "
        "Fill password => pass123. "
        "Click on the login button."
    )
    assert page.url.endswith("/dashboard"), f"Failed: {output}"
```

